      "content": "That makes sense. Can you finish the thought on the suppression systems? Also, beyond these structural issues, I'm interested in the more \"elusive\" or unpredictable variables. Are there any subtle, hidden, or even \"mischievous\" little issues—like tiny electrical faults in deep crevices or unexpected chemical behaviors—that tend to pop up unannounced and cause sudden failures in these environments?",
